    "title": "Tata Motors Commercial South Asia Partners is Hiring: Warehouse Manager (Lead)",
    "description": "Grow your career with Tata Motors Commercial South Asia Partners! We are hiring a Warehouse Manager for our Srinagar team. Be part of a workplace that celebrates innovation, diversity, and performance.\n\nAbout Tata Motors Commercial South Asia Partners:\nTata Motors Commercial South Asia Partners is a leading organization in the Hybrid sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Prepare MIS reports on delivery performance and SLA adherence\n• Manage a fleet of vehicles and coordinate with drivers\n• Manage relationships with third-party logistics providers\n• Optimize delivery routes to reduce cost and improve efficiency\n• Manage reverse logistics and return merchandise authorization\n• Ensure proper handling, packaging, and labeling of goods\n• Track shipments in real-time and resolve delivery exceptions\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• B.Com / M.Com / MBA Finance\n• 12-20 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in TMS\n• Proficiency in Route Optimization\n• Proficiency in INCOTERMS\n• Proficiency in 3PL Management\n• Proficiency in Data Analytics\n• Proficiency in Inventory Management\n• Proficiency in WMS\n• Proficiency in Cold Chain Logistics\n\nWork Mode: Hybrid - Flexible work-from-home and office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• International travel opportunities for senior roles\n• Work-from-home flexibility\n• Referral bonus program\n• Life and accident insurance\n• Modern office with recreational facilities\n• Salary Range: 35 LPA - 70 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Srinagar, Jammu & Kashmir, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Tata Motors Commercial South Asia Partners!",
